HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The mmoouunntt__mmssddooss utility first appeared in NetBSD 0.9.  Its predecessor,
     the mmoouunntt__ppccffss utility, appeared in NetBSD 0.8, and was abandoned in fa‐
     vor of the more aptly named mmoouunntt__mmssddooss.

